&lt;li&gt;Bring designs to life through high-quality visual work, motion design, and attention to micro-interactions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support research initiatives by contributing to planning, synthesizing insights, and applying findings to your designs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Uphold and apply our design system and visual language across platforms&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take initiative and drive work forward even when things are ambiguous—we’re looking for someone with grit and a hustle mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
