&lt;li&gt;Develop technical requirements alongside our Product team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solve problems that span multiple interconnected systems with distributed architectures and scaling systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute on the full lifecycle of new features with fellow engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continue to improve how we build, test, and deliver software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
